                <pb facs="0526" n="398" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg398"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">560.M3/53: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chief of the American
                        Delegation</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-05T12:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5, 1928—12
                                noon</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>4. Your 15, July 8, noon. Department is satisfied that you have done all that
                    could have been expected and leaves your future course entirely to your
                    judgment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
